{"schema":1,"kind":"decision","id":"01M2MH650JR9PETERGNADD0998","title":"Gate policy activation at reload, not at write","decision":"The daemon fingerprints the served policy+capability files and refuses reload/SIGHUP on drift unless a harness.configure picto is consumed; startup drift is audited but loaded. Chosen because the mapper cannot see writes made by opaque programs (scripts, mv, editors) and gommage has zero heuristics.","alternatives":[{"option":"Mapper rule for interpreters (python3/bun/node) mentioning ~/.gommage","why_rejected":"misses hardcoded paths inside the script; the 2026-09-16 incident had no path on the command line"},{"option":"Filesystem watcher auto-reload with fingerprint check","why_rejected":"adds a dependency and a race; reload is already the explicit activation verb (IPC + SIGHUP)"},{"option":"Fail closed at startup on drift","why_rejected":"would brick the operator after any hand edit + restart; process lifecycle is theirs under the same-UID trust model"},{"option":"Read-only chmod on policy.d/capabilities.d","why_rejected":"breaks the gated Edit path too and is OS-enforced, not gommage-enforced"}],"scope":["crates/gommage-daemon/src/main.rs","crates/gommage-core/src/runtime.rs","crates/gommage-core/src/mapper.rs","crates/gommage-audit/src/lib.rs"],"commits":["e2b09edd17fba340c2e77cb08622fb9d411788d6"],"author":"codex","confidence":"medium","tags":[],"ts":1789542994962}
